Jenkins Project-Based Matrix Authorization
Overview
This task configures Jenkins local user access using the Project-based Matrix Authorization Strategy. A local user named siva is created and granted read-only access globally and to the existing Helloworld job. The admin account retains administrative access.
Environment
- Jenkins version: 2.541.2
- Jenkins home: /var/lib/jenkins
- Existing job: Helloworld
- Security realm: Jenkins' built-in user database (HudsonPrivateSecurityRealm)
- Authorization strategy: Project-based Matrix Authorization Strategy
- Matrix Authorization plugin: 3.3
