Implementation summary
The configuration was applied through the Jenkins Script Console using the authenticated administrator account and a valid Jenkins CSRF crumb.

The script:
1. Confirmed the existing Jenkins local security realm.
2. Created the siva account if it did not already exist.
3. Set the user's full name to Siva.
4. Replaced the previous authorization strategy with ProjectMatrixAuthorizationStrategy.
5. Granted admin Overall → Administer.
6. Granted siva Overall → Read.
7. Set the Helloworld job matrix to grant siva Job → Read.
8. Saved the Jenkins and job configuration.
